This software retrieves data from the publicly accessible endpoint
www.tagesschau.de/api2u/, operated by ARD-aktuell. The delivered news
items are content of the ARD broadcasters (Inhalte der ARD-Anstalten),
remain subject to their rights and to the terms of use of
tagesschau.de:
https://www.tagesschau.de/nutzungsbedingungen/

Applicable limits: at most 60 requests per hour, and no republication
of the content except for offerings under a CC licence
(https://tagesschau.de/creativecommons). Compliance is the
responsibility of whoever operates a given instance.

This is an unofficial project, not affiliated with, operated,
